{
  "version": "0.4",
  "title": "Camp Detail - Single Template",
  "type": "jet-engine",
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "specs-detail",
      "elType": "widget",
      "widgetType": "html",
      "settings": {
        "html": "<!--\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nCAMP DETAIL PAGE - DESIGN SPECIFICATIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nPAGE STRUCTURE:\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n1. Breadcrumb (optional - depends on theme)\n2. Image Gallery (5 images grid)\n3. Main Content (2 columns):\n   - Left Column: Title, Description, Included, Spot, Reviews\n   - Right Column: Booking Card (sticky)\n4. Similar Camps Section\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n1. IMAGE GALLERY\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nLayout: CSS Grid\n• Grid template: 2fr 1fr 1fr (columns) × 2 rows\n• Main image: 2 rows tall (left side)\n• 4 smaller thumbnails (right side, 2×2)\n• Gap: 12px\n• Border radius: 24px (container)\n• Height: 400px total (desktop), 300px (tablet), 240px (mobile)\n\nImages:\n• Source: Featured image + gallery meta field\n• Object fit: cover\n• Dynamic tags: [jet-engine-dynamic-field field=\"gallery\"]\n\nGallery Actions (overlay on main image):\n• Position: absolute, top-right\n• Share button (icon)\n• Favorite button (heart icon)\n• Background: White, rounded, shadow\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n2. MAIN CONTENT - LEFT COLUMN\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n2.1 BADGES & TITLE\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nBadges (inline):\n• Sport badge: Dynamic from sport taxonomy\n  - Background: Color based on sport\n  - Padding: 4px 12px\n  - Border radius: 16px\n  - Font: DM Sans 500, 12px\n• Level badge: Dynamic from level field\n  - Background: Light gray\n  - Color: Dark gray\n\nTitle:\n• Source: Post title\n• Typography: DM Sans 700, 36px (desktop), 30px (tablet), 24px (mobile)\n• Color: Slate 900\n• Line height: 1.2\n• Margin bottom: 16px\n\nMeta Row:\n• Display: Flex row, wrap\n• Gap: 24px\n• Border bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0\n• Padding bottom: 24px\n• Margin bottom: 24px\n\nMeta Items:\n• Location: [map-pin icon] + location field\n• Dates: [calendar icon] + start_date - end_date\n• Duration: [clock icon] + duration field\n• Group size: [users icon] + group_size field\n• Rating: [star icon] + rating + (reviews_count)\n\n2.2 COACH PREVIEW\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n• Container with light background (#F8FAFC)\n• Padding: 20px\n• Border radius: 16px\n• Margin bottom: 32px\n\nLayout:\n• Avatar (left, 64px circle)\n• Info (middle): Name, Bio snippet\n• View Profile button (right)\n\nDynamic Tags:\n• Avatar: coach relation → _thumbnail_id\n• Name: coach relation → post_title\n• Bio: coach relation → bio field (truncated to 100 chars)\n\n2.3 DESCRIPTION\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n• Heading: \"About This Camp\" (DM Sans 700, 24px)\n• Content: WYSIWYG field \"description\"\n• Typography: DM Sans 400, 16px, line-height 1.625\n• Color: Slate 700\n• Margin bottom: 32px\n\n2.4 WHAT'S INCLUDED\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n• Heading: \"What's Included\" (DM Sans 700, 24px)\n• List from \"included_items\" repeater field\n• Each item: [check icon] + text\n• Display: Grid 2 columns (desktop), 1 column (mobile)\n• Gap: 16px\n• Icon color: Teal (#14B8A6)\n• Margin bottom: 32px\n\n2.5 THE SPOT\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n• Heading: \"The Spot\" (DM Sans 700, 24px)\n• Spot relation data:\n  - Image (from spot CPT)\n  - Name (h4)\n  - Description\n  - Conditions (wind, waves, etc.)\n• Link to spot single page\n• Margin bottom: 32px\n\n2.6 REVIEWS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n• Heading: \"Reviews\" (DM Sans 700, 24px)\n• Average rating display (large)\n• Reviews list (from reviews CPT relation)\n• Each review:\n  - Avatar + Name + Rating stars\n  - Date\n  - Review text\n• Pagination if > 5 reviews\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n3. BOOKING CARD (Right Column - Sticky)\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nContainer:\n• Background: White\n• Border: 1px solid #E2E8F0\n• Border radius: 24px\n• Padding: 24px\n• Box shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)\n• Position: Sticky, top: 100px\n• Max width: 380px\n\nElements:\n1. Price Display:\n   • Amount: [price field] (DM Sans 700, 32px)\n   • Unit: \"/person\" (gray, 16px)\n   • Margin bottom: 16px\n\n2. Dates Display:\n   • Icon + text\n   • Source: start_date - end_date\n   • Margin bottom: 12px\n\n3. Spots Available:\n   • Text: \"spots_available / group_size spots left\"\n   • Color: Teal if available, Orange if low (<3)\n   • Margin bottom: 20px\n\n4. Book Now Button:\n   • Full width\n   • Background: Teal (#14B8A6)\n   • Padding: 16px\n   • Border radius: 12px\n   • Typography: DM Sans 600, 16px\n   • Link to booking/checkout page with camp ID\n\n5. Trust Badges (below button):\n   • Free cancellation\n   • Secure payment\n   • Money back guarantee\n   • Small icons + text\n   • Gray color\n   • Font size: 12px\n\n6. Contact Coach:\n   • Link to contact form or email\n   • Icon + text\n   • Border top: 1px\n   • Padding top: 20px\n   • Margin top: 20px\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n4. SIMILAR CAMPS SECTION\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n• Heading: \"Similar Camps\" (DM Sans 700, 32px)\n• Layout: Grid 4 columns (desktop), 2 (tablet), 1 (mobile)\n• Gap: 24px\n• Uses JetEngine Listing Grid\n• Query: Same sport taxonomy, exclude current post\n• Limit: 4 camps\n• Uses same camp-card-loop-item template\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nDYNAMIC TAGS REFERENCE:\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nCamp Fields:\n• title → post_title\n• description → description (WYSIWYG)\n• price → price (number)\n• location → location (text)\n• start_date → start_date (date)\n• end_date → end_date (date)\n• duration → duration (text, e.g. \"7 days\")\n• group_size → group_size (number)\n• spots_available → spots_available (number)\n• level → level (select)\n• rating → rating (number)\n• reviews_count → reviews_count (number)\n• included_items → included_items (repeater)\n• gallery → gallery (gallery)\n\nRelations:\n• coach → coach (relation to coach CPT)\n• spot → spot (relation to spot CPT)\n• sport → sport (taxonomy)\n\nCoach Fields (via relation):\n• coach → post_title\n• coach → bio\n• coach → _thumbnail_id\n\nSpot Fields (via relation):\n• spot → post_title\n• spot → description\n• spot → conditions\n• spot → _thumbnail_id\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nEND OF SPECIFICATIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n-->"
      },
      "elements": []
    },
